  "description": "Matomo analytics inside the Umbraco backoffice. Adds an \"Analytics\" section\n      with Realtime, Visitors, Behaviour, Acquisition and Technology dashboards,\n      and an \"Analytics\" tab on every document showing that page's traffic,\n      referrers, previous/next pages, locations and devices — all read live from\n      your own Matomo (self-hosted or cloud) through its Reporting API. Editors\n      get the numbers where they work, without a Matomo login. Optional Google\n      PageSpeed Insights and Search Console tabs come with the shared\n      Flowcourier.Umbraco.Analytics.Core package. Configured from appsettings\n      (endpoint, token, site id); no database schema; the token never leaves the\n      server.",
